   <text>
      <body>
         <div>
            <head>
               <figure>
                  <graphic url="Guettar_title.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic001" type="thumbnail"/>
                  <head type="imgCaption">Franziska Schwemmer</head>
               </figure>
               <label>Name (English)</label>
               <name xml:lang="eng">El Guettar</name>
               <label>Name (Fuṣḥā, transcription)</label>
               <name xml:lang="ara-x-DMG">al-Qaṭṭār</name>
               <label>Name in local variety (in transcription)</label>
               <name xml:lang="aeb-Latn" type="latLoc">l-Gṭāṛ</name>
               <label>Name (Fuṣḥā, Arabic)</label>
               <name xml:lang="ara">القطار</name>
            </head>
            <div type="positioning">
               <head>Geo location</head>
               <p>
                  <geo>34.28949, 9.02349</geo>
               </p>
            </div>
            <div type="typology">
               <head>Typology (Local)</head>
               <p rend="typology" xml:space="preserve">West (Maghreb) › Tunisia › Southern Tunisia</p>
               <p>Bedouin-type dialect</p>
            </div>
            <div type="general">
               <figure rendition="#slideshow">
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic002" url="IMG_20190825_091549199-1-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190825_091549199-1-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic002" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>View from the oldest mosque's tower</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic003" url="IMG_20190825_092317412-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190825_092317412-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic003" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Residents showing the oldest local mosque</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic004" url="IMG_20190824_103558119-1-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_103558119-1-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic004" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>On a bike tour through the palmery next to the mountains</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic005" url="IMG_20190824_090315598-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_090315598-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic005" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Researcher Franzi riding on the remains of a tractor</head>
                  </figure>
               </figure>
               <p xml:space="preserve">El Guettar, located in the southwest Tunisian governorate of Gafsa, is famous for its former natural water sources (<hi xml:lang="aeb" rendition="#i">ʕyūn</hi>)<hi xml:lang="aeb" rendition="#i">. </hi>Though they have dried out decades ago, El Guettar’s residential quarters are named after the numerous former springs. </p>
               <p>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic006" url="IMG_20190824_111649504-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_111649504-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic006" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Spring holes in the palmery</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic007" url="IMG_20190824_111816861-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_111816861-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic007" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Gathering around a former water source</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic008" url="IMG_20190829_090946792-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190829_090946792-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic008" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Dry riverbed</head>
                  </figure>
               </p>
               <p xml:space="preserve">As the small town lies on the foot of a mountain range, its landscape's dry riverbeds are reminiscent of their water flows of former times. Even today, El Guettar is still a town with many green areas, such as palm forests, orchards and vast olive groves. Thus, olives – and its oil –, pistachios, dates, figs and cactus fruits are El Guettar’s most important agricultural products. </p>
               <figure rendition="#slideshow">
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic009" url="IMG_20190824_101914929-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_101914929-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic009" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Impression of the diverse landscape</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic010" url="IMG_20190824_121522323-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_121522323-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic010" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Palm fronds with fruits</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic011" url="IMG_20190824_082147426-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_082147426-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic011" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Dates hanging on a palmtree</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic012" url="IMG_20190824_102036342-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_102036342-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic012" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Fresh cropped pistachios</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic013" url="IMG_20190824_101906894-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_101906894-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic013" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Cactus plant with Indian figs</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic014" url="IMG_20190826_105126837-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190826_105126837-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic014" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Tasty fresh fig</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic015" url="IMG_20190826_104835123-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190826_104835123-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic015" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Fig tree with fruits</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic016" url="IMG_20190824_102058123-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_102058123-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic016" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Olive tree with fruits</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic017" url="IMG_20190824_191856077-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_191856077-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic017" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Olive grove</head>
                  </figure>
               </figure>
               <p>Since people produce their foodstuff mainly by themselves using traditional techniques, they also manufacture tools like millstones (<hi xml:lang="aeb" rendition="#i">rḥā</hi>). </p>
               <p>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic018" url="IMG_20190828_100041164-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190828_100041164-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic018" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>El Guettar. Millstone manufacturer</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic019" url="IMG_20190828_100331624-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190828_100331624-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic019" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Millstone</head>
                  </figure>
               </p>
               <p xml:space="preserve">For many residents of El Guettar, agriculture and livestock breeding form their livelihood. In addition to that, the local phosphate industry as well as the governorate’s capital Gafsa, which is just at a 20 km distance from El Guettar, provide jobs.</p>
               <figure rendition="#slideshow">
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic020" url="Guettar-dough.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="Guettar-dough.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic020" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Preparing the bread dough</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic021" url="Guettar-prepare.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="Guettar-prepare.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic021" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Baking bread</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic022" url="Guettar-leaves.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="Guettar-leaves.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic022" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Preparing food picking leaves</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic023" url="Guettar-couscous.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="Guettar-couscous.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic023" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Couscous with leaves</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic024" url="Guettar-mtabga.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="Guettar-mtabga.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic024" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Preparing Mtabga (home-made Tunisian pizza)</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic025" url="Guettar-mtabga2.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="Guettar-mtabga2.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic025" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Preparing Mtabga (home-made Tunisian pizza)</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic026" url="Guettar-mtabga3.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="Guettar-mtabga3.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic026" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Home-made pizza Mtabga</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic027" url="Guettar-couscous2.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="Guettar-couscous2.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic027" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Couscous with local vegetables and Harrisa</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic028" url="Guettar-palm.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="Guettar-palm.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic028" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Local working on a date palm</head>
                  </figure>
               </figure>
               <p xml:space="preserve">One of the town’s tourist attractions is a hill called <hi xml:lang="aeb" rendition="#i">il-</hi><hi xml:lang="aeb" rendition="#i">galʕa</hi> (the actual meaning of this word is “fort“) that offers a panoramic view from its top. People attribute special importance to it: Locals but also pilgrims from other parts of Tunisia head for the hill’s caves to celebrate ceremonies with animal sacrifices there.</p>
               <figure rendition="#slideshow">
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic029" url="IMG_20190824_120404363-1-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_120404363-1-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic029" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Mountain hill called Galea with sourroundings</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic030" url="IMG_20190828_190449485-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190828_190449485-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic030" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Caves on the mountain hill Galea</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic031" url="IMG_20190824_195910713-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_195910713-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic031" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>A look into a cave on the Galea hill</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic032" url="IMG_20190824_195806482-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_195806482-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic032" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>Bone remains on the Galea hill</head>
                  </figure>
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="fullscale" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic033" url="IMG_20190824_120746569-scaled.jpg"/>
                     <graphic url="IMG_20190824_120746569-scaled.jpg" decls="#profile_El_Guettar_01_graphic033" type="thumbnail"/>
                     <head>The galea sourrounded by trees in front of mountain hills</head>
                  </figure>
               </figure>
               <p xml:space="preserve">Additionally, some local saints and their shrines are located in the small town.</p>
