                     <head>Yard inside the shrine building</head>
                  </figure>
               </figure>
            </div>
            <div type="researchHistory">
               <p xml:space="preserve">To the best of our knowledge hitherto no research has been done on the dialect of El Guettar, however this dialect is linguistically investigated within the TUNOCENT project.</p>
